<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδ-ιαῖος</span></b>  (spelt <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιεῖος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>in Tht.</u>
					27.6
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πούς</span>) <i>a foot long,
				broad,</i> or <i>high,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.372.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.4
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνεται μὲν ὁ ἥλιος π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					428b3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Math.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. [γραμμή</span>] side <i>of one
				foot long,</i> taken as the unit of length, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				147d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				446a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1052b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδιαῖον ποιησάμενοι ἐφιᾶσι</span>
			<i>loosen</i> the sail <i>by the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πούς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				851b8
			</span></i>.</div>
